<section class="rt-reviews-section" id="Reviews">
  <div class="rt-section-header">
    <span class="rt-section-badge">COMMUNITY & SOCIAL PROOF</span>
    <h2 class="rt-section-title">Verified Watch Owners</h2>
    <p class="rt-section-sub">
      Over 1,480+ happy collectors, creators, and everyday wearers across India.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rt-reviews-grid">
    <div class="rt-review-card">
      <div>
        <div class="rt-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rt-review-text">
          "Honestly didn't expect much for ₹999 but this thing is SOLID. The metal feels proper heavy, not like those plastic ones you get on Amazon. My roommate thought it cost 5-6k lol. Only complaint — wish the strap was a tiny bit longer, had to remove one link."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-review-author">
        <div>
          <div class="rt-author-name">Arjun M.</div>
          <div class="rt-author-location">Bandra, Mumbai</div>
        </div>
        <span class="rt-verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-review-card">
      <div>
        <div class="rt-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rt-review-text">
          "Bought this for my boyfriend's birthday and now I lowkey want one for myself 😂 The backlight is so cool at night, we kept pressing it in the dark like kids. Packaging was neat too, came in a proper box."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-review-author">
        <div>
          <div class="rt-author-name">Pooja S.</div>
          <div class="rt-author-location">Indiranagar, Bangalore</div>
        </div>
        <span class="rt-verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-review-card">
      <div>
        <div class="rt-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rt-review-text">
          "COD option was the reason I ordered tbh, don't trust prepaid for new sites. But wow, delivered in 2 days to South Delhi. Watch looks exactly like the pics. Already ordered another one as a gift."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-review-author">
        <div>
          <div class="rt-author-name">Karan V.</div>
          <div class="rt-author-location">Hauz Khas, New Delhi</div>
        </div>
        <span class="rt-verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-review-card">
      <div>
        <div class="rt-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rt-review-text">
          "I've been wearing Casio since college and this is legit the real deal. Same weight, same click on the buttons, same everything. Was skeptical ordering online but it's 100% original. The alarm is loud enough to wake me up which is a bonus 😅"
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-review-author">
        <div>
          <div class="rt-author-name">Rohit K.</div>
          <div class="rt-author-location">Koramangala, Bangalore</div>
        </div>
        <span class="rt-verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-review-card">
      <div>
        <div class="rt-review-stars">★★★★☆</div>
        <p class="rt-review-text">
          "Really nice watch, looks great with kurtas and casuals both. Giving 4 stars only because delivery took 4 days to Jaipur instead of 2, but the watch itself is perfect. My dad saw it and said 'we used to wear these in the 80s' — so yeah, authentic vibes."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-review-author">
        <div>
          <div class="rt-author-name">Sneha R.</div>
          <div class="rt-author-location">Malviya Nagar, Jaipur</div>
        </div>
        <span class="rt-verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-review-card">
      <div>
        <div class="rt-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rt-review-text">
          "Third Casio vintage I own but first time buying from here. Price is genuinely the lowest I've found anywhere and it's not a fake — checked the serial and everything. Super lightweight, I forget I'm wearing it half the time. 10/10 would recommend."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-review-author">
        <div>
          <div class="rt-author-name">Vikram T.</div>
          <div class="rt-author-location">Anna Nagar, Chennai</div>
        </div>
        <span class="rt-verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

